  "content_html": "<div id=\"main\">\n\t\t<section id=\"primary\">\n\t\t\t<div id=\"content\" role=\"main\">\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"article-div divider\">\t\t\t\t\n<article id=\"post-3742\" class=\"post-3742 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-css category-javascript\">\n\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/3742/%e8%b6%85%e5%a4%af%ef%bc%81%e8%a6%96%e5%b7%ae%e6%8d%b2%e8%bb%b8%e5%8b%95%e7%95%ab%e5%a4%a7%e8%a7%a3%e5%af%86%ef%bc%81\" title=\"Permalink to 超夯！視差捲軸動畫大解密！\" rel=\"bookmark\">超夯！視差捲軸動畫大解密！</a></h2>\n    <p class=\"entry-posted\">\n      <time datetime=\"2014-05-14T10:01:17+00:00\" title=\"2014-05-14T10:01:17+00:00\" class=\"published\">\n        <a title=\"See all posts from May, 2014\" href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/date/2014/03\" class=\"posted-month\">3月</a>\n        <span class=\"posted-date\">31</span>\n        <a title=\"See all posts from 2014\" href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/date/2014\" class=\"posted-year\">2014</a>\n      </time>\n    </p>\n      \t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-meta\">\n      <div id=\"author-meta\">\n        <a href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/author/elinmozilla-com\">\n          <img src=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/wp-content/uploads/avatars/61/2bc97977e9095bce9de29d4fa9dfac5b-bpthumb.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"avatar user-61-avatar\" width='24' height='24' /><div id=\"author-info\">小y</div>\n        </a>\n        </div>\n        <div id=\"post-date\">\n                  </div>\n      </div><!-- .entry-meta -->\n\t\t\t</header><!-- .entry-header -->\n\n\n\t<div class=\"thumb-img\"><img src=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/wp-content/uploads/2013/12/螢幕快照-2013-12-17-下午4.23.17-150x150.png\"/></div>\t<div class=\"entry-content half\">\n\t\t前面介紹過了去年九月份活動頁的 Canvas 刮刮樂、以及照片上傳元件。\r\n這次重頭戲來啦！\r\n登登登！傳說中的～視差動畫！\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n設定你的視差捲軸動畫\r\n\r\n\r\n先構思好動畫的進行方式，視差故名思義就是景物因遠近不同造成視線內移動速度的差異，\r\n最常見的例子是在坐車時，距離較近的建築物很快從窗前經過，遠方的山卻看不出來有移動，\r\n因此本文前面展示的範例就是示範如何處理遠、中、近不同距.....<a class=\"more\" href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/3742/%e8%b6%85%e5%a4%af%ef%bc%81%e8%a6%96%e5%b7%ae%e6%8d%b2%e8%bb%b8%e5%8b%95%e7%95%ab%e5%a4%a7%e8%a7%a3%e5%af%86%ef%bc%81\">深入了解</a>  \n\t</div><!-- .entry-content -->\n\t\n  <footer class=\"entry-footer\">\n            <div class=\"entry-category-box\">\n      文章分類：\n      <a href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/category/css\" title=\"觀看分類「CSS」的全部文章\" rel=\"category tag\">CSS</a>、<a href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/category/javascript\" title=\"觀看分類「Javascript」的全部文章\" rel=\"category tag\">Javascript</a>    </div>\n        <div class=\"entry-social-box\">\n      社群分享：\n     <div class=\"fb-like\" data-href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/3742/%e8%b6%85%e5%a4%af%ef%bc%81%e8%a6%96%e5%b7%ae%e6%8d%b2%e8%bb%b8%e5%8b%95%e7%95%ab%e5%a4%a7%e8%a7%a3%e5%af%86%ef%bc%81\" data-layout=\"button_count\" data-width=\"40\" data-show-faces=\"false\" data-font=\"arial\"></div>     <!-- Place this tag where you want the +1 button to render. -->\n     \n     <div class=\"google-share\"><div class=\"g-plusone\" name=\"gplus\" data-size=\"medium\" data-annotation=\"bubble\" data-width=\"40\" data-href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/3742/%e8%b6%85%e5%a4%af%ef%bc%81%e8%a6%96%e5%b7%ae%e6%8d%b2%e8%bb%b8%e5%8b%95%e7%95%ab%e5%a4%a7%e8%a7%a3%e5%af%86%ef%bc%81\"></div></div>     \n    <div class=\"pinterest-share\"><a href=\"http://pinterest.com/pin/create/button/?url=http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/3742/%e8%b6%85%e5%a4%af%ef%bc%81%e8%a6%96%e5%b7%ae%e6%8d%b2%e8%bb%b8%e5%8b%95%e7%95%ab%e5%a4%a7%e8%a7%a3%e5%af%86%ef%bc%81&media=http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/wp-content/uploads/2013/12/螢幕快照-2013-12-17-下午4.23.17-150x150.png\" data-pin-do=\"buttonPin\" data-pin-config=\"none\" data-pin-color=\"red\" class=\"pin-it-button\"><img border=\"0\" src=\"//assets.pinterest.com/images/PinExt.png\" title=\"Pin It\" /></a></div>      <div class=\"plurk-share\">\n        <a href=\"javascript: void(window.open('http://www.plurk.com/?qualifier=shares&status=' .concat(encodeURIComponent('http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/3742/%e8%b6%85%e5%a4%af%ef%bc%81%e8%a6%96%e5%b7%ae%e6%8d%b2%e8%bb%b8%e5%8b%95%e7%95%ab%e5%a4%a7%e8%a7%a3%e5%af%86%ef%bc%81')) .concat(' ') .concat('&#40;') .concat(encodeURIComponent(document.title)) .concat('&#41;')));\">\n          <img src=\"http://statics.plurk.com/2980c7bcb4eb012159e7701a61cb2e75.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"plurk share\">\n        </a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"comment-share\">\n        <a class=\"comment-button\" href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/3742/%e8%b6%85%e5%a4%af%ef%bc%81%e8%a6%96%e5%b7%ae%e6%8d%b2%e8%bb%b8%e5%8b%95%e7%95%ab%e5%a4%a7%e8%a7%a3%e5%af%86%ef%bc%81#respond\">留言<div class=\"count-bubble\">0</div></a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </footer>\n\n</article><!-- #post-3742 -->\n</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"article-div divider\">\t\t\t\t\n<article id=\"post-3738\" class=\"post-3738 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-javascript\">\n\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/3738/%e7%80%8f%e8%a6%bd%e5%99%a8%e7%9a%84%e9%a0%90%e8%a8%ad-file-input-%e4%b8%8d%e5%a5%bd%e7%94%a8%ef%bc%81%e6%88%91%e6%83%b3%e8%87%aa%e8%a8%82%e7%be%8e%e8%a7%80%e5%af%a6%e7%94%a8%e7%9a%84%e7%85%a7\" title=\"Permalink to 瀏覽器的預設 File Input 不好用！我想自訂美觀實用的照片上傳元件怎麼辦？\" rel=\"bookmark\">瀏覽器的預設 File Input 不好用！我想自訂美觀實用的照片上傳元件怎麼辦？</a></h2>\n    <p class=\"entry-posted\">\n      <time datetime=\"2014-05-14T10:01:17+00:00\" title=\"2014-05-14T10:01:17+00:00\" class=\"published\">\n        <a title=\"See all posts from May, 2014\" href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/date/2014/03\" class=\"posted-month\">3月</a>\n        <span class=\"posted-date\">24</span>\n        <a title=\"See all posts from 2014\" href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/date/2014\" class=\"posted-year\">2014</a>\n      </time>\n    </p>\n      \t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-meta\">\n      <div id=\"author-meta\">\n        <a href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/author/elinmozilla-com\">\n          <img src=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/wp-content/uploads/avatars/61/2bc97977e9095bce9de29d4fa9dfac5b-bpthumb.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"avatar user-61-avatar\" width='24' height='24' /><div id=\"author-info\">小y</div>\n        </a>\n        </div>\n        <div id=\"post-date\">\n                  </div>\n      </div><!-- .entry-meta -->\n\t\t\t</header><!-- .entry-header -->\n\n\n\t<div class=\"thumb-img\"><img src=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/wp-content/uploads/2013/12/螢幕快照-2013-12-17-下午3.51.22-150x150.png\"/></div>\t<div class=\"entry-content half\">\n\t\t接續前一篇介紹 Canvas 刮刮樂的文章，\r\n本篇介紹的是去年九月份 Firefox OS 讓你盡情享受每一刻 活動的照片上傳作法。\r\n\r\n有做過上傳表單的人一定對瀏覽器提供的預設上傳元件有一些意見，\r\n它的外觀光用 CSS 來設定樣式也救不了，而且上傳圖片沒有前端預覽很不直覺。\r\n幸好可以搭配&lt;label&gt;元素改變表單元素外觀，以及新的 FileReader API 以在上傳前預覽.....<a class=\"more\" href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/3738/%e7%80%8f%e8%a6%bd%e5%99%a8%e7%9a%84%e9%a0%90%e8%a8%ad-file-input-%e4%b8%8d%e5%a5%bd%e7%94%a8%ef%bc%81%e6%88%91%e6%83%b3%e8%87%aa%e8%a8%82%e7%be%8e%e8%a7%80%e5%af%a6%e7%94%a8%e7%9a%84%e7%85%a7\">深入了解</a>  \n\t</div><!-- .entry-content -->\n\t\n  <footer class=\"entry-footer\">\n            <div class=\"entry-category-box\">\n      文章分類：\n      <a href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/category/javascript\" title=\"觀看分類「Javascript」的全部文章\" rel=\"category tag\">Javascript</a>    </div>\n        <div class=\"entry-social-box\">\n      社群分享：\n     <div class=\"fb-like\" data-href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/3738/%e7%80%8f%e8%a6%bd%e5%99%a8%e7%9a%84%e9%a0%90%e8%a8%ad-file-input-%e4%b8%8d%e5%a5%bd%e7%94%a8%ef%bc%81%e6%88%91%e6%83%b3%e8%87%aa%e8%a8%82%e7%be%8e%e8%a7%80%e5%af%a6%e7%94%a8%e7%9a%84%e7%85%a7\" data-layout=\"button_count\" data-width=\"40\" data-show-faces=\"false\" data-font=\"arial\"></div>     <!-- Place this tag where you want the +1 button to render. -->\n     \n     <div class=\"google-share\"><div class=\"g-plusone\" name=\"gplus\" data-size=\"medium\" data-annotation=\"bubble\" data-width=\"40\" data-href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/3738/%e7%80%8f%e8%a6%bd%e5%99%a8%e7%9a%84%e9%a0%90%e8%a8%ad-file-input-%e4%b8%8d%e5%a5%bd%e7%94%a8%ef%bc%81%e6%88%91%e6%83%b3%e8%87%aa%e8%a8%82%e7%be%8e%e8%a7%80%e5%af%a6%e7%94%a8%e7%9a%84%e7%85%a7\"></div></div>     \n    <div class=\"pinterest-share\"><a href=\"http://pinterest.com/pin/create/button/?url=http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/3738/%e7%80%8f%e8%a6%bd%e5%99%a8%e7%9a%84%e9%a0%90%e8%a8%ad-file-input-%e4%b8%8d%e5%a5%bd%e7%94%a8%ef%bc%81%e6%88%91%e6%83%b3%e8%87%aa%e8%a8%82%e7%be%8e%e8%a7%80%e5%af%a6%e7%94%a8%e7%9a%84%e7%85%a7&media=http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/wp-content/uploads/2013/12/螢幕快照-2013-12-17-下午3.51.22-150x150.png\" data-pin-do=\"buttonPin\" data-pin-config=\"none\" data-pin-color=\"red\" class=\"pin-it-button\"><img border=\"0\" src=\"//assets.pinterest.com/images/PinExt.png\" title=\"Pin It\" /></a></div>      <div class=\"plurk-share\">\n        <a href=\"javascript: void(window.open('http://www.plurk.com/?qualifier=shares&status=' .concat(encodeURIComponent('http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/3738/%e7%80%8f%e8%a6%bd%e5%99%a8%e7%9a%84%e9%a0%90%e8%a8%ad-file-input-%e4%b8%8d%e5%a5%bd%e7%94%a8%ef%bc%81%e6%88%91%e6%83%b3%e8%87%aa%e8%a8%82%e7%be%8e%e8%a7%80%e5%af%a6%e7%94%a8%e7%9a%84%e7%85%a7')) .concat(' ') .concat('&#40;') .concat(encodeURIComponent(document.title)) .concat('&#41;')));\">\n          <img src=\"http://statics.plurk.com/2980c7bcb4eb012159e7701a61cb2e75.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"plurk share\">\n        </a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"comment-share\">\n        <a class=\"comment-button\" href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/3738/%e7%80%8f%e8%a6%bd%e5%99%a8%e7%9a%84%e9%a0%90%e8%a8%ad-file-input-%e4%b8%8d%e5%a5%bd%e7%94%a8%ef%bc%81%e6%88%91%e6%83%b3%e8%87%aa%e8%a8%82%e7%be%8e%e8%a7%80%e5%af%a6%e7%94%a8%e7%9a%84%e7%85%a7#respond\">留言<div class=\"count-bubble\">3</div></a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </footer>\n\n</article><!-- #post-3738 -->\n</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"article-div divider\">\t\t\t\t\n<article id=\"post-3748\" class=\"post-3748 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-firefox category-life-at-mozilla\">\n\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/3748/%e4%b8%80%e8%b5%b7%e5%8b%95%e6%89%8b%e5%81%9a%e5%90%a7%ef%bc%81%e7%94%a8%e8%bf%b7%e4%bd%a0%e7%a9%8d%e6%9c%a8%e6%8b%bc%e5%87%ba%e4%b8%80%e9%9a%bb%e5%b0%8f%e7%81%ab%e7%8b%90\" title=\"Permalink to 一起動手做吧！用迷你積木拼出一隻小火狐\" rel=\"bookmark\">一起動手做吧！用迷你積木拼出一隻小火狐</a></h2>\n    <p class=\"entry-posted\">\n      <time datetime=\"2014-05-14T10:01:17+00:00\" title=\"2014-05-14T10:01:17+00:00\" class=\"published\">\n        <a title=\"See all posts from May, 2014\" href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/date/2013/12\" class=\"posted-month\">12月</a>\n        <span class=\"posted-date\">24</span>\n        <a title=\"See all posts from 2014\" href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/date/2013\" class=\"posted-year\">2013</a>\n      </time>\n    </p>\n      \t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-meta\">\n      <div id=\"author-meta\">\n        <a href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/author/elinmozilla-com\">\n          <img src=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/wp-content/uploads/avatars/61/2bc97977e9095bce9de29d4fa9dfac5b-bpthumb.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"avatar user-61-avatar\" width='24' height='24' /><div id=\"author-info\">小y</div>\n        </a>\n        </div>\n        <div id=\"post-date\">\n                  </div>\n      </div><!-- .entry-meta -->\n\t\t\t</header><!-- .entry-header -->\n\n\n\t<div class=\"thumb-img\"><img src=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/wp-content/uploads/2013/12/nanoblock-firefox.16.complete-150x150.png\"/></div>\t<div class=\"entry-content half\">\n\t\t\r\n難得破例不講技術，耶誕節快到了，應該要來點輕鬆的。\r\n狐迷們，今天我們一起用積木來做一隻小火狐吧！\r\n\r\n首先要準備的積木材料如下圖：\r\n\r\n從頭到尾分解步驟\r\n底下開始詳細的圖文分解步驟，只要一步步照著做，很快就可以完成你的積木小火狐囉！\r\n\r\n\r\n1. 首先照上圖把小火狐的頭組裝起來，注意第四步最左邊的方塊底下要裝鼻子（如圖 3 ），\r\n所以不要讓底部的卡榫擋住中間，否則鼻子會裝不上去。\r.....<a class=\"more\" href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/3748/%e4%b8%80%e8%b5%b7%e5%8b%95%e6%89%8b%e5%81%9a%e5%90%a7%ef%bc%81%e7%94%a8%e8%bf%b7%e4%bd%a0%e7%a9%8d%e6%9c%a8%e6%8b%bc%e5%87%ba%e4%b8%80%e9%9a%bb%e5%b0%8f%e7%81%ab%e7%8b%90\">深入了解</a>  \n\t</div><!-- .entry-content -->\n\t\n  <footer class=\"entry-footer\">\n            <div class=\"entry-category-box\">\n      文章分類：\n      <a href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/category/firefox\" title=\"觀看分類「Firefox」的全部文章\" rel=\"category tag\">Firefox</a>、<a href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/category/life-at-mozilla\" title=\"觀看分類「Life at Mozilla」的全部文章\" rel=\"category tag\">Life at Mozilla</a>    </div>\n        <div class=\"entry-social-box\">\n      社群分享：\n     <div class=\"fb-like\" data-href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/3748/%e4%b8%80%e8%b5%b7%e5%8b%95%e6%89%8b%e5%81%9a%e5%90%a7%ef%bc%81%e7%94%a8%e8%bf%b7%e4%bd%a0%e7%a9%8d%e6%9c%a8%e6%8b%bc%e5%87%ba%e4%b8%80%e9%9a%bb%e5%b0%8f%e7%81%ab%e7%8b%90\" data-layout=\"button_count\" data-width=\"40\" data-show-faces=\"false\" data-font=\"arial\"></div>     <!-- Place this tag where you want the +1 button to render. -->\n     \n     <div class=\"google-share\"><div class=\"g-plusone\" name=\"gplus\" data-size=\"medium\" data-annotation=\"bubble\" data-width=\"40\" data-href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/3748/%e4%b8%80%e8%b5%b7%e5%8b%95%e6%89%8b%e5%81%9a%e5%90%a7%ef%bc%81%e7%94%a8%e8%bf%b7%e4%bd%a0%e7%a9%8d%e6%9c%a8%e6%8b%bc%e5%87%ba%e4%b8%80%e9%9a%bb%e5%b0%8f%e7%81%ab%e7%8b%90\"></div></div>     \n    <div class=\"pinterest-share\"><a href=\"http://pinterest.com/pin/create/button/?url=http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/3748/%e4%b8%80%e8%b5%b7%e5%8b%95%e6%89%8b%e5%81%9a%e5%90%a7%ef%bc%81%e7%94%a8%e8%bf%b7%e4%bd%a0%e7%a9%8d%e6%9c%a8%e6%8b%bc%e5%87%ba%e4%b8%80%e9%9a%bb%e5%b0%8f%e7%81%ab%e7%8b%90&media=http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/wp-content/uploads/2013/12/nanoblock-firefox.16.complete-150x150.png\" data-pin-do=\"buttonPin\" data-pin-config=\"none\" data-pin-color=\"red\" class=\"pin-it-button\"><img border=\"0\" src=\"//assets.pinterest.com/images/PinExt.png\" title=\"Pin It\" /></a></div>      <div class=\"plurk-share\">\n        <a href=\"javascript: void(window.open('http://www.plurk.com/?qualifier=shares&status=' .concat(encodeURIComponent('http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/3748/%e4%b8%80%e8%b5%b7%e5%8b%95%e6%89%8b%e5%81%9a%e5%90%a7%ef%bc%81%e7%94%a8%e8%bf%b7%e4%bd%a0%e7%a9%8d%e6%9c%a8%e6%8b%bc%e5%87%ba%e4%b8%80%e9%9a%bb%e5%b0%8f%e7%81%ab%e7%8b%90')) .concat(' ') .concat('&#40;') .concat(encodeURIComponent(document.title)) .concat('&#41;')));\">\n          <img src=\"http://statics.plurk.com/2980c7bcb4eb012159e7701a61cb2e75.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"plurk share\">\n        </a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"comment-share\">\n        <a class=\"comment-button\" href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/3748/%e4%b8%80%e8%b5%b7%e5%8b%95%e6%89%8b%e5%81%9a%e5%90%a7%ef%bc%81%e7%94%a8%e8%bf%b7%e4%bd%a0%e7%a9%8d%e6%9c%a8%e6%8b%bc%e5%87%ba%e4%b8%80%e9%9a%bb%e5%b0%8f%e7%81%ab%e7%8b%90#respond\">留言<div class=\"count-bubble\">0</div></a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </footer>\n\n</article><!-- #post-3748 -->\n</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"article-div divider\">\t\t\t\t\n<article id=\"post-3502\" class=\"post-3502 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-css category-javascript category-open-source\">\n\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/3502/%e7%b6%b2%e9%a0%81%e4%b8%8a%e4%b9%9f%e8%83%bd%e5%81%9a%e5%88%ae%e5%88%ae%e6%a8%82%ef%bc%81%e9%81%8b%e7%94%a8-html5-canvas-%e5%90%88%e6%88%90%e5%8a%9f%e8%83%bd\" title=\"Permalink to 網頁上也能做刮刮樂！運用 HTML5 canvas 合成功能\" rel=\"bookmark\">網頁上也能做刮刮樂！運用 HTML5 canvas 合成功能</a></h2>\n    <p class=\"entry-posted\">\n      <time datetime=\"2014-05-14T10:01:17+00:00\" title=\"2014-05-14T10:01:17+00:00\" class=\"published\">\n        <a title=\"See all posts from May, 2014\" href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/date/2013/12\" class=\"posted-month\">12月</a>\n        <span class=\"posted-date\">13</span>\n        <a title=\"See all posts from 2014\" href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/date/2013\" class=\"posted-year\">2013</a>\n      </time>\n    </p>\n      \t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-meta\">\n      <div id=\"author-meta\">\n        <a href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/author/elinmozilla-com\">\n          <img src=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/wp-content/uploads/avatars/61/2bc97977e9095bce9de29d4fa9dfac5b-bpthumb.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"avatar user-61-avatar\" width='24' height='24' /><div id=\"author-info\">小y</div>\n        </a>\n        </div>\n        <div id=\"post-date\">\n                  </div>\n      </div><!-- .entry-meta -->\n\t\t\t</header><!-- .entry-header -->\n\n\n\t<div class=\"thumb-img\"><img src=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/wp-content/uploads/2013/11/螢幕快照-2013-12-03-下午10.50.53-150x150.png\"/></div>\t<div class=\"entry-content half\">\n\t\t我就先不賣關子，底下這個 fiddle 就是這篇文章的刮刮樂範例完整版。\r\n可以玩玩看，試著瞭解裡面的程式腳本，或是 fork 來改改看。\r\n有興趣但看不太懂 code 的話， 就跟著本篇文章的介紹帶你入門吧！\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n如果大家有看過九月份的「Firefox OS 讓你儘情享受每一刻」活動網頁（註 1），\r\n\r\n應該很好奇一開始的刮刮樂是如何做到的吧？\r\n在研究該如何實作這個功能的時.....<a class=\"more\" href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/3502/%e7%b6%b2%e9%a0%81%e4%b8%8a%e4%b9%9f%e8%83%bd%e5%81%9a%e5%88%ae%e5%88%ae%e6%a8%82%ef%bc%81%e9%81%8b%e7%94%a8-html5-canvas-%e5%90%88%e6%88%90%e5%8a%9f%e8%83%bd\">深入了解</a>  \n\t</div><!-- .entry-content -->\n\t\n  <footer class=\"entry-footer\">\n            <div class=\"entry-category-box\">\n      文章分類：\n      <a href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/category/css\" title=\"觀看分類「CSS」的全部文章\" rel=\"category tag\">CSS</a>、<a href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/category/javascript\" title=\"觀看分類「Javascript」的全部文章\" rel=\"category tag\">Javascript</a>、<a href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/category/open-source\" title=\"觀看分類「Open Source」的全部文章\" rel=\"category tag\">Open Source</a>    </div>\n        <div class=\"entry-social-box\">\n      社群分享：\n     <div class=\"fb-like\" data-href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/3502/%e7%b6%b2%e9%a0%81%e4%b8%8a%e4%b9%9f%e8%83%bd%e5%81%9a%e5%88%ae%e5%88%ae%e6%a8%82%ef%bc%81%e9%81%8b%e7%94%a8-html5-canvas-%e5%90%88%e6%88%90%e5%8a%9f%e8%83%bd\" data-layout=\"button_count\" data-width=\"40\" data-show-faces=\"false\" data-font=\"arial\"></div>     <!-- Place this tag where you want the +1 button to render. -->\n     \n     <div class=\"google-share\"><div class=\"g-plusone\" name=\"gplus\" data-size=\"medium\" data-annotation=\"bubble\" data-width=\"40\" data-href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/3502/%e7%b6%b2%e9%a0%81%e4%b8%8a%e4%b9%9f%e8%83%bd%e5%81%9a%e5%88%ae%e5%88%ae%e6%a8%82%ef%bc%81%e9%81%8b%e7%94%a8-html5-canvas-%e5%90%88%e6%88%90%e5%8a%9f%e8%83%bd\"></div></div>     \n    <div class=\"pinterest-share\"><a href=\"http://pinterest.com/pin/create/button/?url=http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/3502/%e7%b6%b2%e9%a0%81%e4%b8%8a%e4%b9%9f%e8%83%bd%e5%81%9a%e5%88%ae%e5%88%ae%e6%a8%82%ef%bc%81%e9%81%8b%e7%94%a8-html5-canvas-%e5%90%88%e6%88%90%e5%8a%9f%e8%83%bd&media=http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/wp-content/uploads/2013/11/螢幕快照-2013-12-03-下午10.50.53-150x150.png\" data-pin-do=\"buttonPin\" data-pin-config=\"none\" data-pin-color=\"red\" class=\"pin-it-button\"><img border=\"0\" src=\"//assets.pinterest.com/images/PinExt.png\" title=\"Pin It\" /></a></div>      <div class=\"plurk-share\">\n        <a href=\"javascript: void(window.open('http://www.plurk.com/?qualifier=shares&status=' .concat(encodeURIComponent('http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/3502/%e7%b6%b2%e9%a0%81%e4%b8%8a%e4%b9%9f%e8%83%bd%e5%81%9a%e5%88%ae%e5%88%ae%e6%a8%82%ef%bc%81%e9%81%8b%e7%94%a8-html5-canvas-%e5%90%88%e6%88%90%e5%8a%9f%e8%83%bd')) .concat(' ') .concat('&#40;') .concat(encodeURIComponent(document.title)) .concat('&#41;')));\">\n          <img src=\"http://statics.plurk.com/2980c7bcb4eb012159e7701a61cb2e75.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"plurk share\">\n        </a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"comment-share\">\n        <a class=\"comment-button\" href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/3502/%e7%b6%b2%e9%a0%81%e4%b8%8a%e4%b9%9f%e8%83%bd%e5%81%9a%e5%88%ae%e5%88%ae%e6%a8%82%ef%bc%81%e9%81%8b%e7%94%a8-html5-canvas-%e5%90%88%e6%88%90%e5%8a%9f%e8%83%bd#respond\">留言<div class=\"count-bubble\">2</div></a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </footer>\n\n</article><!-- #post-3502 -->\n</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"article-div divider\">\t\t\t\t\n<article id=\"post-2390\" class=\"post-2390 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-mozilla category-open-source\">\n\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/2390/%e6%83%b3%e5%ad%b8-pythondjango-%e5%b0%b1%e5%be%9e-mozilla-%e7%b6%b2%e7%ab%99%e5%b0%88%e6%a1%88%e9%96%8b%e5%a7%8b%e5%90%a7%ef%bc%81\" title=\"Permalink to 想學 Python/Django? 就從 Mozilla 網站專案開始吧！\" rel=\"bookmark\">想學 Python/Django? 就從 Mozilla 網站專案開始吧！</a></h2>\n    <p class=\"entry-posted\">\n      <time datetime=\"2014-05-14T10:01:17+00:00\" title=\"2014-05-14T10:01:17+00:00\" class=\"published\">\n        <a title=\"See all posts from May, 2014\" href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/date/2013/07\" class=\"posted-month\">7月</a>\n        <span class=\"posted-date\">08</span>\n        <a title=\"See all posts from 2014\" href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/date/2013\" class=\"posted-year\">2013</a>\n      </time>\n    </p>\n      \t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-meta\">\n      <div id=\"author-meta\">\n        <a href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/author/elinmozilla-com\">\n          <img src=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/wp-content/uploads/avatars/61/2bc97977e9095bce9de29d4fa9dfac5b-bpthumb.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"avatar user-61-avatar\" width='24' height='24' /><div id=\"author-info\">小y</div>\n        </a>\n        </div>\n        <div id=\"post-date\">\n                  </div>\n      </div><!-- .entry-meta -->\n\t\t\t</header><!-- .entry-header -->\n\n\n\t<div class=\"thumb-img\"><img src=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/909381308_2992d3d096_o-150x150.jpg\"/></div>\t<div class=\"entry-content half\">\n\t\t（圖片來源：radiobread）\n六月的時候 Askeing 大大介紹了 Python 開發好幫手 - virtualenv ，如果你剛好是 Python/Django 的新手，能照著 Askeing 的解說順利地完成 virtualenv 安裝使用，那麼這篇文章可以給你一個自己學習建立 Django 專案的起點。\n為什麼要學 Python？\n如果你還不知道 Python/Django 是什麼，.....<a class=\"more\" href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/2390/%e6%83%b3%e5%ad%b8-pythondjango-%e5%b0%b1%e5%be%9e-mozilla-%e7%b6%b2%e7%ab%99%e5%b0%88%e6%a1%88%e9%96%8b%e5%a7%8b%e5%90%a7%ef%bc%81\">深入了解</a>  \n\t</div><!-- .entry-content -->\n\t\n  <footer class=\"entry-footer\">\n            <div class=\"entry-category-box\">\n      文章分類：\n      <a href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/category/mozilla\" title=\"觀看分類「Mozilla」的全部文章\" rel=\"category tag\">Mozilla</a>、<a href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/category/open-source\" title=\"觀看分類「Open Source」的全部文章\" rel=\"category tag\">Open Source</a>    </div>\n        <div class=\"entry-social-box\">\n      社群分享：\n     <div class=\"fb-like\" data-href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/2390/%e6%83%b3%e5%ad%b8-pythondjango-%e5%b0%b1%e5%be%9e-mozilla-%e7%b6%b2%e7%ab%99%e5%b0%88%e6%a1%88%e9%96%8b%e5%a7%8b%e5%90%a7%ef%bc%81\" data-layout=\"button_count\" data-width=\"40\" data-show-faces=\"false\" data-font=\"arial\"></div>     <!-- Place this tag where you want the +1 button to render. -->\n     \n     <div class=\"google-share\"><div class=\"g-plusone\" name=\"gplus\" data-size=\"medium\" data-annotation=\"bubble\" data-width=\"40\" data-href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/2390/%e6%83%b3%e5%ad%b8-pythondjango-%e5%b0%b1%e5%be%9e-mozilla-%e7%b6%b2%e7%ab%99%e5%b0%88%e6%a1%88%e9%96%8b%e5%a7%8b%e5%90%a7%ef%bc%81\